ConsoleServer Debian packaging policy
=====================================

This package is intended for inclusion in a SONiC image.

It installs seriald.service but deliberately does not use dh_installsystemd,
and it does not enable or start seriald.service.

The SONiC image build installs and enables a separate
console-server.service under sonic.target.

Standalone Linux installation continues to use the repository Makefile and
the ./console installer.

The maintainer identity and copyright/license text under debian/ must be
updated to the project's official values before release.